  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FASA Financing Agri SMEs in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FASA is a multi-donor fund which provides concessional capital to investment vehicles with the objective of catalyzing commercial capital for agri-SMEs in Africa. The purpose of FASA Fund is to support the African agriculture sector and advance development impacts, including enhanced food security and nutrition, improved smallholder livelihoods, sustainable land use, nature-positive approaches, and a more resilient environment across the economy, while promoting gender equity and climate-smart practices, specifically through the mobilization of capital.</narrative>
  </description>
